  "schema:description": "&lt;h2&gt;Data Sources Summary&lt;/h2&gt; &lt;p&gt; This entry summarizes the data sources used for the paper &lt;b&gt;“Dyadic Interaction Platform: A novel tool to study transparent social interactions”&lt;/b&gt; published by &lt;i&gt;eLife&lt;/i&gt; (&lt;a href=&quot;https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.106757.1&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://doi.org/10.7554/eLife.106757.1&lt;/a&gt;). &lt;/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Original source:&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/8r6e2/&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/8r6e2/&lt;/a&gt; &lt;/p&gt; &lt;hr&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Transparent Economic Games&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt; The &lt;b&gt;BoS dataset&lt;/b&gt; described in this section and links to the GitHub code repositories are available at the public OSF repository: &lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/f5u8z&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/f5u8z&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Continuous Strategic Interactions&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;ul&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;b&gt;Competitive Foraging task:&lt;/b&gt; Data and code are available at &lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/8r6e2/files/osfstorage&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/8r6e2/files/osfstorage&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/li&gt; &lt;li&gt; &lt;b&gt;Cooperation–Competition Foraging study:&lt;/b&gt; Data and code are available at the public OSF repository &lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/56hw7&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/56hw7&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/li&gt; &lt;/ul&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Perceptual Decision-Making in Dyadic Context&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt; The data and code related to the &lt;b&gt;CPR DIP dataset&lt;/b&gt; are available here: &lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/8r6e2/files/osfstorage&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/8r6e2/files/osfstorage&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt; &lt;h3&gt;Attention and Social Learning&lt;/h3&gt; &lt;p&gt; The dataset and code described in this section are available at the public OSF repository: &lt;a href=&quot;https://osf.io/6dven&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://osf.io/6dven&lt;/a&gt;. &lt;/p&gt;",
